# Per-developer GCP deploy config (copied from cloud-run.env.example)
# Docker Compose auto-loads this for ${VAR} substitution. It carries JWT_SECRET_KEY
# (row adce3547) and must never be committable — the whole point of that row is a
# signing secret sitting in a tracked file on a public repo.
.env

