src/scripts/cloud-run-model-server.env

# VM-local compose env files. Four places in the tree already CALL these
# git-ignored (docker-compose.cloud-gpu.yml:18, preflight-vm-lib.sh:224,
# lupin-vm.sh:45, vm-unversioned-manifest.tsv:44) and until this line they
# were not — `git check-ignore` returned nothing for either. They carry
# DB_PASSWORD and JWT_SECRET_KEY per src/conf/env-contract.tsv, i.e. exactly
# what the `.env` rule above exists to keep out of a tracked file.
cloud-gpu.env
cloud-test.env

# Terraform — local state, provider cache, and secret-bearing tfvars.
# (.terraform.lock.hcl IS committed — it pins provider versions.)
src/terraform/**/.terraform/
src/terraform/**/*.tfstate
src/terraform/**/*.tfstate.*
src/terraform/**/terraform.tfvars
src/terraform/**/*.auto.tfvars
src/terraform/**/crash.log

# Skip the io directory (logs, outputs, etc.) — runtime artifacts.
# Pattern is `io/**` (recursive contents) rather than `io/` (whole dir) so the
# committed visual-regression baselines below can be re-included: git cannot
# re-include a path whose parent directory is excluded as a whole.
io/**

# EXCEPTION — playwright visual-regression baselines are git-TRACKED so they
# round-trip into a fresh :8000 / CI test container (CI-portable; no host-resident
# dependency). Scoped carve: re-include ONLY io/test-suite/visual-baselines/ — the
# failure-diff store (io/test-suite/visual-failures/) and all other io/ artifacts
# stay ignored. Wiring: pytest.ini `playwright_visual_snapshots_path`. (task 6ca79dc2)
!io/test-suite/
!io/test-suite/visual-baselines/
!io/test-suite/visual-baselines/**

# EXCEPTION — the pre-rendered dry-run podcast fixture is git-TRACKED so it ships
# with the repo and never has to be regenerated. It is a REAL mp3 (Maria + Mr.
# Radio narrating what dry-run mode does) that PodcastGeneratorJob._execute_dry_run
# serves through the overlay path, making a dry-run submit a zero-cost end-to-end
# exercise of that path. Same carve pattern as visual-baselines above.
!io/fixtures/
!io/fixtures/podcast-dry-run/
!io/fixtures/podcast-dry-run/**

# Same runtime-artifact class as io/** above, but written UNDER src/ when the
# codebase-analysis tools (loc-delta / git-delta CSV+PNG) run with cwd=src or
# cwd=src/cosa. src/io/ is pure output (no source) → ignore wholesale; for
# src/cosa/io/ ignore ONLY the output subdirs so the dir stays available for the
# io-helper source CLAUDE.md PROJECT STRUCTURE designates there.
src/io/
src/cosa/io/git-delta-analysis/
src/cosa/io/git-loc-delta/

# Omit Mail Map
.mailmap

# Skip the question embeddings dictionary, this can always be regenerated
src/conf/long-term-memory/question-embeddings-dictionary.pickle

# Re-don't want to track venv!
venv/**
# NOT `/.venv/` — a trailing slash matches DIRECTORIES ONLY, so a SYMLINK named .venv
# (how a worktree gets one: src/scripts/link-worktree-venv.sh) is a FILE to git and stays
# UNTRACKED in every worktree that adopts it. Measured, row f42ac20c. The bare form covers
# both shapes.
/.venv

# Python web server artifact
nohup.out

# skip anything contained within a directory called foo
**/foo/**

# Skip your voice come in training data, it's too big!
# Why isn't this exclusion working?!?
**/voice-commands-xml-*.jsonl
# The rotated previous copy (row 11390b57). Same file, same 196 MB, one suffix later —
# and the pattern above does NOT match it, because it ends .jsonl.prev not .jsonl.
**/voice-commands-xml-*.jsonl.prev
# The corpus fingerprint sidecar. DELIBERATELY NOT TRACKED: it describes the LOCAL
# artifact, and that artifact is ignored. A tracked stamp would travel to a checkout
# holding a DIFFERENT local artifact and certify a pairing that never existed — a false
# PASS, which is the one failure this guard must never have. A fresh checkout has no
# artifact at all, so it returns "no artifact yet" and generates; it never reaches the
# stamp check. See src/cosa/training/corpus_fingerprint.py.
**/voice-commands-xml.fingerprint.json
#src/ephemera/prompts/data/voice-commands-xml-test.jsonl
#src/ephemera/prompts/data/voice-commands-xml-train.jsonl
#src/ephemera/prompts/data/voice-commands-xml-validate.jsonl
.codiumai

